From 251051fcf6ff70f8bc64d956a3817c039ef0bb81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritvik <ritvik2014@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:50:14 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 26/40] liquid glass: glass on glass is light or dark as the
 glass under it

Controls (layer 1) decided light or dark each from its own reading, so a
row of them split into light and dark ones inside one panel and flickered
by themselves. They now take the state of the layer 0 glass they sit on,
crossfading with it, and layer 1 reads nothing back.
